{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261112/photo/bkn-20261112232720567-1112_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261112232935\"/><p>案發地點位於洛根圓環附近。</p><p>美國華盛頓一處健身中心周四（12日）發生槍擊事件，警方稱釀成至少5人受傷，槍人逃入一幢建築物。另有目擊者指，現場至少一人身亡。</p><p>事發後，大批執法人員封鎖現場，正尋找一名身穿灰色襯衫白人男性疑犯。案發地點位於洛根圓環附近，距離白宮約1.6公里。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T15:43:55.281860+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T15:27:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T15:37:26.455639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T15:37:26.455639+00:00","content_hash":"30cac9eb907371d60975e0dce34df5a707c7dbc222daf0fbac4e4434e21dd10b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}